OVERVIEW

Creative Audio operates an internal application that accesses the Amazon
Ads API exclusively to manage and analyze our own Amazon advertising
account. This privacy notice explains how we handle any data accessed through
that integration.

This application is not a commercial product or service. It is not offered to
the public, and no third parties use or have access to it.

================================================================================

DATA WE ACCESS

Through the Amazon Ads API, we access advertising performance data
associated solely with our own Amazon Ads account. This may include campaign
metrics, ad group data, keyword performance, bid and budget information, and
related reporting data.

We do not collect, store, or process personal data belonging to any individual
outside of Creative Audio.

================================================================================

HOW WE USE THIS DATA

We use the accessed data for internal business purposes only, including:

  - Monitoring and analyzing our own advertising campaign performance
  - Generating internal reports and dashboards
  
All use of this data is strictly internal to Creative Audio.

